      "n": null,
      "n_counts": "animal studies",
      "verbatim": "Langley concluded that relying on animal surrogates of human illnesses is a flawed approach in science. Her own investigations, as well as several published systematic reviews of the reliability of animal models, have shown that fewer than 50 % of animal studies have predicted human outcomes sufficiently."
